## Model card

- **Name:** Ling-3.2-flash
- **Short description:** Ant Group’s Ling-3.2-flash is a native multimodal MoE model (560B total / 25B active, 1M context) supporting image/text/video input, focused on complex visual understanding, multimodal agents, 3D/medical multimodal tasks.
- **Provider / access:** Ant Ling developer platform / Ant Bailian and third-party platforms per docs. Local metadata lists `opencode/ling-3.2-flash`, pricing $0.30/$0.90 per 1M, and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Ant Ling model documentation reviewed 2026-11-10. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed source.
- **IDs:** `Ling-3.2-flash`, `ling-3.2-flash`.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens (docs/local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, and video input; text output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.30 / $0.90 per 1M input/output tokens on Ant Bailian launch pricing (local metadata; time-limited trial noted).
- **Architecture:** MoE multimodal model, 560B total / 25B active parameters (docs).

